> Full and compact descriptor encoders execute

The encoder subtracts.5 from observed RGB and uses13 biased He-normal SAME
ReLU convolutions,four2x2/stride2 VALID pools,learned GeM,a bias-free normal
projection,and unit normalization with squared-norm floor1e-12. There is no
pretrained model,whitening,augmentation,BN or dropout. Full widths produce
128D descriptors with14,780,225 scalars/28 leaves. Compact widths divided by8
produce32D descriptors with232,617 scalars/28 leaves. Both retain19 recorded
stages. The learned rho and projection are warmed before optimizer creation.

```{cpp, results="markdown", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>

#include <print>
int main() {
  namespace n = dm::nn;
  n::set_num_threads(2);
  for (int divisor : {1, 8}) {
    const int dimensions = divisor == 1 ? 128 : 32;
    n::ParameterStore p(227);
    auto rgb = (.5 + .4 * n::sin(n::arange(0, 2 * 3072).reshape({2, 32, 32, 3}) * .17))
                   .requires_grad_();
    const auto net = n::models::RetrievalEncoder(p, rgb, divisor, dimensions);
    auto variables = p.parameters();
    variables.push_back(rgb);
    const auto weights = n::sin(n::arange(0, 2 * dimensions).reshape({2, dimensions}) * .13);
    const auto gradient = n::grad(n::sum(net.descriptor * weights), variables);
    if (p.count() != (divisor == 1 ? 14780225 : 232617) || p.size() != 28 ||
        net.stages.size() != 19 || gradient.size() != 29)
      return 1;
    for (const auto &g : gradient)
      if (!g.defined() || !std::isfinite(n::norm(g).item()) ||
          (divisor == 8 && n::norm(g).item() <= 0))
        return 1;
    std::print("{}:{} learned scalars,28 finite parameter gradients plus RGB;19 stages,{}D "
               "descriptors,initial p {:.6f}. No fitting.\n",
               divisor == 1 ? "Full" : "Compact", p.count(), dimensions, net.exponent.item());
  }
}
```
// result_begin: markdown
Full:14780225 learned scalars,28 finite parameter gradients plus RGB;19 stages,128D descriptors,initial p 3.000000. No fitting.
Compact:232617 learned scalars,28 finite parameter gradients plus RGB;19 stages,32D descriptors,initial p 3.000000. No fitting.
